So I've been sick for a week,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:22.440
And I've been trying to get the videos out anyway and...

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.540
Really forcing it to work, but

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.480
Today I just feel like I can't be bothered.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.300
I just-

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.660
Yeah.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.280
So instead of getting half ass shitty video you get a half ass shitty video but in an honest way

