I realised I haven't taken a day off for being sick since I started making videos,

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.240
which is kinda weird.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.500
I really love doing the videos and I hate to miss a day coz I'm just not feeling well.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.560
This video is literally just me feeling bad, sorry for myself,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.160
like, "oh no, poor me".

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.080
Literally I just want to get back on my feet again. I wanna be healthy again,

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.700
and I'm sick of being sick.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.860
You ever feel like that?

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.800
You still go to school, so I bet not.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.800
So yeah I decided to do an update vlog instead again.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.000
A lot of people seem to be concerned about my health lately,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.960
Because I seem skinnier but I think its because I just shaved the beard.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.280
I'm not doing cocaine...

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.880
at the moment.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.680
