00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:46.480
What I discovered that exercising is really important to me,

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.340
Because it takes out so much stress from YouTube.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.980
Oh my God, I did it again.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.380
YouTube is so hard!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.900
It's not.

