00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.600
I still live with Marzia. We're still together.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.220
You can calm the fuck down thank you very much.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.680
I hate being sick. *laughs*

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:43.800
I used to love being sick. When did this change?

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:48.120
I guess when you really love what you do, that really changes your perspectives on things.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:53.360
But yeah, I dont record in my house because of the same reason I got kicked out of my other office.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.920
You never know what's gonna happen,

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.340
and my videos are loud,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.220
and there's gotta be problems.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:03.080
British people are so fucking passive-aggressive.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.200
It's weird.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:08.200
So far, no landlord has been knocking on the door outside,

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.500
So I think that's pretty good.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.540
I think thats a good sign.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.340
I wanna say thank you for supporting the channel.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:18.120
